  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 6 parts x 5 rows (昭和 6–10, 年度) = 30 as printed. Printed in two column groups (two header blocks); each group has the three sub-blocks 本科入學志願者 / 本科入學者 / 本科入學志願者百中本科入學者, so six parts.",
   "Column 文學 (專門學校) is empty in all rows of the first group (the printed (1) mark in the 昭和 6 and 7 志願者 rows stands left of the 語學 figure, across the rule, and is written with that figure: '(1)8,495', '(1)7,936'). Empty cells = \"\". Printed percentages of 文學 column likewise absent; 語學 percentages are in the 語學 column.",
   "Footnote marks written in front of the figure as printed: (1)2,288, (1)2,440 (數學理化學), (1)1,961, (1)1,874 (美術), (2)28 (音學 昭和 6).",
   "Comma/period: figures printed '5.517' (入學者, 法學, 昭和 7), '3.224' and '3.709' (入學者, 實業專門學校 商業, 昭和 6 and 8) have a period in place of the thousands comma; written with a comma. '94 111' and '97 446' (高等女學校 入學者 昭和 9, 10) print the comma faintly/not at all; written with a comma.",
   "Informational cross-check of the percentage blocks (not used to alter any figure): ratio 入學者/志願者 as read differs from the printed percentage by more than rounding in these cells — 昭和 6 美術 (printed 28.62; 275/1,961=14.0), 昭和 7 美術 (25.40; 222/1,874=11.9), 昭和 7 實科高等女學校 (86.13; 8,898/9,983=89.13), 昭和 8 中學校 (63.28; 75,357/118,929=63.36), 昭和 8 高等女學校 (60.20; 89,577/148,637=60.27), 昭和 8 醫學 (13.30; 1,194/10,565=11.30), 昭和 8 經濟學 (86.42; 631/788=80.08), 昭和 8 數學理化學 (25.04; 143/591=24.2), 昭和 10 商科醫學 (46.77; 1,036/2,322=44.62), and in the second group 昭和 6 帝國大學 (63.31; 6,131/9,540=64.27). Figures were re-read on enlarged crops and are written as read; the discrepancy lies in the printed figures/percentages as far as can be seen.",
   "Unit heading and 内地 note: title '入學志願者及入學者 (內地)'. No unreadable cells."
  ],
